      "prompt": "一元线性回归 f(x)=wx+b 中，若训练样本 x 的均值 x̄=5、y 的均值 ȳ=3，且已求得 w=2，则闭式解给出的截距 b 等于多少？（提示：b = ȳ − w·x̄）",
      "choices": [],
      "expected_answer": {
        "value": -7,
        "absolute_tolerance": 0.01
      },
      "deterministic_scorer": "numeric_answer_v1",
      "misconception_rules": [],
