        "hint": "闭式解中 b = ȳ − w·x̄ = 3 − 2×5。",
        "explanation": "一元回归闭式解 b = ȳ − w x̄，代入得 b = 3 − 2×5 = −7。"
      },
      "benchmark_case_ids": [
        "stat_ml_linear_intercept_correct",
        "stat_ml_linear_intercept_wrong"
      ]
